# default-midnight-violet-5k (M13b): the page at rest full screen on a 5K display (the user's Studio
# Display: 2560 x 1440 points at density 2, 5120 x 2880 pixels) in midnight-violet, the one theme
# whose curve glows. The release build's redraw is timed at this size and at 1440 x 900
# (default-midnight-violet; README: Release). React's first paint settles within 1.5 s, so the shot
# waits 2 s.
size 2560 1440
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme midnight-violet
wait 2000
shot default
